# BMAD framework — reinstall it, don't track it. Only _bmad-output/ is tracked.
# Everything below is written by the BMAD installer or its builder, and is
# reproduced by `npx bmad-method install`. Reinstall command of record:
#   npx bmad-method@6 install --modules bmm,tea,bmb --tools claude-code
_bmad/
# Agent-facing skills the installer generates for Claude Code (64 files today).
.claude/skills/
# Where BMad Builder writes generated skills (_bmad/config.toml:40).
/skills/

